curve.patch, for Geometry Change at revision 398491e
(https://github.com/peterfajdiga/kwin4_effect_geometry_change), applied by
nix/kwin-effect-geometry-change.nix. It adds a Curve setting: any of Qt's
easing curves by name (OutExpo, InOutSine, ...), which is how komorebi sets
the curve of its animations. An unknown or missing name is the effect's own
curve, OutExpo.

